 - `mealplan/shopping.py` and `mealplan/cards.py`: the shopping list and the recipe card.
 
+## Allergens
+
+`search`, `suggest`, `similar` and `plan_week` never show a recipe containing one of the customer's allergens: as an
+ingredient, through an ingredient that contains it (butter contains milk), under any name `ingredients.py` knows, or
+through a component recipe at any depth. The check is `mealplan/allergy.py`.
+
